				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manyfold" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3768135); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3768135&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609901529" alt="manyfold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3768135)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/manyfold" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3768135); return false;" >manyfold</a></span> <span class="odate time_1609901502 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">06 Jan 2021 02:51</span>
																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Writing Help / Help: Ideas Critique</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/forum/t-13971172/the-idol-seeking-greenlight">The Idol, seeking greenlight</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4863346">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article and Tale</p>
<p>Page Layout (Optional): Standard layout with a timeline of events addendum. Possible diary addendum for the tale.</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A little statue, that attracts people and creates a sense of purpose and community in people by altering their perception. Closeness to it gives peace and a general sense of wellbeing, distance causes a general sense of slight illness. Those feelings can be strong, but are perfectly manageable.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Central&nbsp;Narrative&nbsp;Hook&nbsp;and&nbsp;Notes</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-collapse</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The core idea perhaps isn't too original, but I was more interested in how it would affects groups of people. How they would organize themselves if they all want to be as close as possible to the statue but at the same time know that in its presence they won't notice their hunger and tiredness and so they might kill themselves. Furthermore they know that they won't be allowed to keep the statue, there are those who will come to take it away, to contain it. So how they plan for it.<br />
And I also try t explore a bit how people who are not exposed to the statue react to it. Sure, the organization tries to contain it, but there might be others who see it as an opportunity.<br />
So beside the basic structure I would present a timeline of the events that led to the capture of the object, and a story in the first person about an attempt to steal it in order to expose a whole SCP facility.<br />
I think presenting it as an addendum works better for one narrative, while presenting it as a story works better for a different narrative.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> Rather than just the danger posed by the anomalous properties themselves I was interested in how the existence of those anomalous properties represent a thought hazard in those who know of them.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I already wrote it and put it on my sandbox, mostly because I was interested in the idea and wanted to expand it, I would like some feedback and I would like to see if other people would enjoy it a much. It's mostly complete, but there are some things that can change based on feedback.<br />
For instance in my original draft the timeline was more detailed and longer, then I streamlined it to the essentials, but I can expand it again if there's interest in it.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

