<p>Muy verdadero 2, final.</p>
<p>I agree, the authors are free to write the hell they want but my point still remains, why?</p>
<p>I know it may sounds conspirational, but to be honest this reinterpretation doesn't add anything substantial to the table (for me), and I think that's my problem with this article.</p>
<p>I'm not sure what was the reasoning behind the rewrite. I share the concerns about the original article and I really wanted them to be changed but instead, we received a cervid like creature that in my humble opinion doesn't have any resemblance to the skip from the original article. (I know we got hints of the nature of her mother and the teenager in the previous iteration of the article)</p>
