<p><strong>Overall</strong>:<br />
I feel like this is missing any sort of narrative. As it stands currently, it would be more fitting as an addition to the anomalous items list document&#8230; If you want to make this into its own article, I think you need to think about what more you want to say.</p>
<ul>
<li>What are the stakes?</li>
<li>What is the overall arc?</li>
<li>How was this discovered?</li>
<li>What are the origins of the this anomaly?</li>
<li>Who could the reader relate to in the article?</li>
<li>What themes are you looking to explore?</li>
