<p>Nice. I like this. Makes for a nice twist at the end. Make sure you try and incorporate the main beats of the narrative in your initial post above. And here's your <span style="color: green"><strong>greenlight</strong></span> :)</p>
<p>Once you get a second one and are done with the draft, let me know and I can take another look. All the best!</p>

